{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Legislate for a \"50+1\" football club ownership model to protect clubs and fans",
        "additional_details": "We believe reckless ownership threatens clubs. A German-style 50+1 model puts fans in the boardroom. A fan voting majority could help:\r\n \r\n- Stop financial ruin\r\n- Prioritise long-term survival over high-risk debt\r\n- Lower ticket prices.\r\n \r\nFans could cap matchday & season ticket costs. Clubs are vital community assets. We believe we need a true fan democracy.",
        "background": "Legislate a mandatory \"50+1\" rule in professional football, requiring fans to hold 50% plus one share of club voting rights. This could give fans a democratic veto, stop reckless financial management, and ensure ticket prices remain affordable.",
